# ==============================================================================
# Reproductive Genetics & Laboratory Wiki — .gitignore
# 保護原則：嚴禁提交金鑰、患者個資、敏感內部文件與不允許再散布之第三方文獻全文；
# 明確保留 AGENTS.md、README.md、wiki/、raw/metadata/、raw/registry.json、
# raw/structured/、logs/、assets/、workflows/ 與 wiki_browser/。
# ==============================================================================

# 1. API Keys, Secrets, Credentials & Environment Files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*secret*
*token*
*credentials*.json
*apikey*

# 2. Patient PII & Un-deidentified Clinical Data (嚴禁入庫)
patient_data/
clinical_records/
pii/
*patient_export*
*unredacted*
*phi*

# 3. Sensitive Internal / Confidential Documents (未經授權不得入庫)
confidential/
internal_sensitive/
private_sop/
validation_reports_private/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx

# 4. Copyrighted / Non-Redistributable Third-Party Full-Text Literature
# 保留本機檔案供 workflows/lint_wiki.py 進行 SHA-256 驗證，但不提交至 Git：
# - SRC-001, SRC-002, SRC-006: © ASRM / Fertility and Sterility (All rights reserved)
# - SRC-003: ACMG / Genetics in Medicine Author Manuscript (Publisher copyright)
# - SRC-004, SRC-005, SRC-007, SRC-008: ESHRE 2020 (CC BY-NC 4.0 Non-Commercial)
# 注意：公司官方來源 raw/sources/SRC-009.md、raw/metadata/、raw/registry.json 與
# raw/structured/ 仍由 Git 正常追蹤。
raw/sources/SRC-001.md
raw/sources/SRC-002.md
raw/sources/SRC-003.md
raw/sources/SRC-004.md
raw/sources/SRC-005.md
raw/sources/SRC-006.md
raw/sources/SRC-007.md
raw/sources/SRC-008.md
raw/sources/restricted/
raw/pdfs/
*.pdf

# 5. Temporary, Cache & OS Metadata Files
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# 6. IDE / Editor Local Settings
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*

# 注意：切勿排除 logs/ 目錄（保留 asset_audit.md、ingest_report.json、
# lint_report.md、lint_report.json 與 human_review_queue.md）。
